   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "Suffragist Clothing Headquarters G and 11th Sts. WASHINGTON, D. C.",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=854,3871,709,329"
  },
  {
   "id": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7/text/r18",
   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "W. W. BROWN",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=1108,3067,229,39"
  },
  {
   "id": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7/text/r19",
   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "vention voted also that each affiliated socicty pay into the National Treasury 10 cents on every member up to 5,000 members, and if this amount is less than 5 per cent of the total expenditures of the affiliated society for the past year, that the society make its contribution equal to 5 per cent of its expenditures. The National Association can thus count on adequate financial provision for the work of the coming vyear.",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=1598,286,701,580"
  },
  {
   "id": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7/text/r20",
   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "The plan to make the literature department of the National Association a stock company, incorporated at $50,000, was launched with very little difficulty. Eleven thousand dollars to float the project was offered on the floor of the Convention within a few minutes.",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=1600,871,701,349"
  },
  {
   "id": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7/text/r21",
   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "The following officers were elected for the coming year: President, Dr. Anna Howard Shaw; First Vice- President, Miss Jane Addams, of Chicago; Second Vice-President, Mrs. Desha Breckenridge, of Kentucky; Third Vice-President, Miss Caroline Ruutz-Rees, of Connecticut; Recording Secretary, Mrs. Susan Walker Fitzgerald, of Massachusetts;, Corresponding Secretary, Mrs. Mary Ware Dennett, of New York; Treasurer, Mrs. Katherine Dexter McCormick, of Massachusetts; First Auditor, Mrs. Harriet Burton Laidlaw, of New York; Second Auditor, Mrs. Louise De- Koven Bowen, of Chicago.",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=1600,1225,705,792"
  },
  {
   "id": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7/text/r22",
   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "A delightful reception, in honor of the officers of the National Association, to delegates and visitors attending the Convention, was given by Senator and Mrs. La Follette, in their home at 3320 Avenue of the Presidents. Those in the receiving line were Senator and Mrs. La Follette, Mrs. Josephus Daniels, Mrs. Albert Sidney Burleson, Mrs. Franklin K. Lane, Mrs. David Franklin Houston, Mrs. Miles Poindexter, Mrs. Reed Smoot, Mrs. Victor Murdock, Mrs. W. L. La Follette, Mrs. J. W. Bryan, Mrs.",
    "format": "text/plain"
   },
   "target": "https://nealcaren.github.io/paperpress-demo/iiif/suffragist/_undated/suffragist01cong_2/canvas/p7#xywh=1606,2023,703,663"
  },
